$DATUM Colorless oil, yield 77.2 mg, 75%. HPLC: t = 6.62 min, purity greater
than 99% (method 1); t = 6.51 min, purity greater than 99% (method 2). 1H
NMR (300 MHz, CDCl3): δ 7.54 (d, 2H, J = 8.7 Hz, phenyl-H), 6.96 (d, 1H,
J = 2.1 Hz, H-1'), 6.90 (d, 2H, J = 8.7 Hz, phenyl-H), 5.86-5.88 (m, 1H,
H-2'), 5.78-5.82 (m, 1H, H-3'), 4.46-4.50 (m, 2H, H-4' + H-5'), 4.15-4.21
(m, 1H, H-5'), 4.03 (s, 3H, -OCH3), 3.84 (s, 3H, -OCH3), 2.16 (s, 3H,
-C(O)CH3), 2.13 (s, 3H, -C(O)CH3), 2.10 (s, 3H, -C(O)CH3). 13C NMR (75
MHz, CDCl3): δ 171.2, 170.1, 170.0, 161.1, 158.1, 148.7, 145.3, 134.3,
114.7, 113.6, 91.7, 90.0, 81.2, 78.6, 74.9, 71.3, 63.3, 55.9, 54.1, 21.3,
21.1. Maldi-MS: m/z 576.1 [M +Na]+. HRMS: calcd for C24H22N3O9F3Na+
576.1200, found 576.1188. IR: 2232.2 cm-1.
