$DATUM Colorless oil, yield 81.0 mg, 73%. HPLC: t = 7.49 min, purity 97.9%
(method 1); t = 7.16 min, purity 96.5% (method 2). 1H NMR (300 MHz,
CDCl3): δ 7.51 (d, 2H, J = 8.1 Hz, phenyl-H), 7.18 (d, 2H, J = 8.1 Hz,
phenyl-H), 6.96 (d, 1H, J = 2.1 Hz, H-1'), 5.86-5.89 (m, 1H, H-2'),
5.78-5.81 (m, 1H, H-3'), 4.45-4.50 (m, 2H, H-4' + H-5'), 4.15-4.21 (m,
1H, H-5'), 4.03 (s, 3H, -OCH3), 2.62 (t, 2H, J = 7.7 Hz, -CH2-), 2.15 (s,
3H, -C(O)CH3), 2.13 (s, 3H, -C(O)CH3), 2.10 (s, 3H, -C(O)CH3), 1.60-1.67
(m, 2H, -CH2-), 1.31-1.38 (m, 4H, -CH2-), 0.90 (t, 3H, J = 6.6 Hz, -CH3).
13C NMR (150 MHz, CDCl3): δ 170.8, 169.7, 169.6, 157.8, 148.3, 145.2,
145.1, 132.3, 128.8, 118.4, 91.5, 89.7, 81.0, 78.7, 74.6, 71.0, 62.9,
53.7, 36.2, 31.6, 31.0, 22.7, 20.9, 20.7, 14.2. Maldi-MS: m/z 578.2 [M +
Na]+. HRMS: calcd for C28H33N3O9Na+ 578.2109, found 578.2101. IR: 2234.4
cm-1.
