$DATUM Colorless oil, yield 71.7 mg, 73%. HPLC: t = 6.66 min, purity greater
than 99% (method 1); t = 6.52 min, purity 96.3% (method 2). 1H NMR (300
MHz, CDCl3): δ 7.38-7.43 (m, 2H, thiophenyl-H), 7.03-7.06 (m, 1H,
thiophenyl-H), 6.96 (d, 1H, J = 2.1 Hz, H-1'), 5.85-5.87 (m, 1H, H-2'),
5.76-5.80 (m, 1H, H-3'), 4.45-4.48 (m, 2H, H-4' + H-5'), 4.15-4.21 (m,
1H, H-5'), 4.03 (s, 3H, -OCH3), 2.16 (s, 3H, -C(O)CH3), 2.13 (s, 3H,
-C(O)CH3), 2.10 (s, 3H, -C(O)CH3). 13C NMR (150 MHz, CDCl3): δ 170.9,
169.8, 169.6, 157.7, 148.0, 145.2, 134.4, 129.4, 127.5, 121.1, 89.8,
84.8, 83.0, 81.0, 74.6, 71.0, 63.0, 53.8, 20.9, 20.7. Maldi-MS: m/z 514.1
[M + Na]+. HRMS: calcd for C21H21N3O9SNa+ 514.0890, found 514.0889. IR:
2228.5 cm-1.
