$DATUM Colorless oil, yield 73.4 mg, 73%. HPLC: t = 6.61 min, purity greater
than 99% (method 1); t = 6.55 min, purity 98.6% (method 2). 1H NMR (300
MHz, CDCl3): δ 7.57-7.61 (m, 2H, phenyl-H), 7.08 (dd, 2H, JHH=JHF=8.7 Hz,
phenyl-H), 6.96 (d, 1H, J = 2.1 Hz, H-1'), 5.85-5.87 (m, 1H, H-2'),
5.77-5.80 (m, 1H, H-3'), 4.44-4.49 (m, 2H, H-4' + H-5'), 4.15-4.21 (m,
1H, H-5'), 4.03 (s, 3H, -OCH3), 2.15 (s, 3H, -C(O)CH3), 2.13 (s, 3H,
-C(O)CH3), 2.09 (s, 3H, -C(O)CH3). 13C NMR (75 MHz, CDCl3): δ 170.8,
169.8, 169.6, 163.5 (d, 1JCF =250.5 Hz), 157.7, 148.0, 145.2, 134.4 (d,
3JCF = 9.0 Hz), 117.4, 116.2 (d, 2JCF = 21.4 Hz), 90.0, 89.8, 80.9, 79.1,
74.6, 71.0, 63.0, 53.8, 20.9, 20.7. Maldi-MS: m/z 526.1 [M + Na]+. HRMS:
calcd for C23H22N3O9FNa+ 526.1232, found 526.1222. IR: 2239.7 cm-1.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
